{"id":"n15843-2-7","stage":3,"title":"반말 · 不敬之词","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15843-2-7-1","ko":"보아 하니, 나보다 나이도 어린 것 같은데 어디서 반말입니까?","zh":"看样子你年纪似乎还比我小，哪来的资格对我用半语啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보아","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；아：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보아","audio":"/audio/91d82bf64508e27dac4b.mp3"}},{"text":"하니,","meaning":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","explanation":"하다：表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}},{"text":"나보다","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나보다","audio":"/audio/6ab7ce48bac772c090d1.mp3"}},{"text":"나이도","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나이도","audio":"/audio/ab1cfd819f0edef183ac.mp3"}},{"text":"어린","meaning":"年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年龄小；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"2","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린","audio":"/audio/f78bf8d27dff1667b0ba.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"怎么，哪里，哪能","explanation":"어디：怎么，哪里，哪能；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60320","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"반말입니까?","meaning":"不敬之词","explanation":"반말：不敬之词；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"반말","audio":"/audio/8576c3c2817c4685963b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15843","senseId":"2","lemma":"반말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반말입니까","audio":"/audio/121bd16cb8e2188195cf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小于比